text:
Three papers accepted at NeurIPS 2026:
- Decoupled Mode Connectivity for Base-to-Novel Generalization in Vision-Language Models;
- Uncertainty is an Underconstrained Axis in Lossy Compression;
- SOLA: A Structured Operator Library for Attention in Pretrained Vision Transformers.

Three papers accepted at ICLR 2026:
- [INSTANT: Compressing Gradients and Activations for Resource-Efficient Training](https://openreview.net/forum?id=P2q6Y7UweV);
- [Efficient Resource-Constrained Training of Vision Transformers via Subspace Optimization](https://openreview.net/forum?id=0nvQ5kHXf4) (**oral**);
- [Study of Training Dynamics for Memory-Constrained Fine-Tuning](https://openreview.net/forum?id=BhfIg0tuti).
